<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike estimate raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it raised its fiscal 1998 earnings per share estimate for Nike Inc to $3.52 from $3.35 based on strong third quarter earnings and a 34 percent increase in future orders.</p>
<p>-- maintained a buy rating on the stock and a price target of $90 to $100.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Nike were up 1-1/4 at 68-3/4 in early trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
